Horde NPC Ability Imp Follow
    Events
        Time - Every 2.00 seconds of game time
    Conditions
    Actions
        -------- ===================================== --------
        Set VariableSet NPC_ImpVarPoint = (Position of NPC_Horde_AI_Warlock)
        If (All Conditions are True) then do (Then Actions) else do (Else Actions)
            If - Conditions
                (NPC_Horde_AI_WarlockImp is alive) Equal to True
                (Distance between (Position of NPC_Horde_AI_WarlockImp) and NPC_ImpVarPoint) Greater than 600.00
            Then - Actions
                Unit - Order NPC_Horde_AI_WarlockImp to Right-Click NPC_Horde_AI_Warlock
            Else - Actions
                If (All Conditions are True) then do (Then Actions) else do (Else Actions)
                    If - Conditions
                        (Current order of NPC_Horde_AI_Warlock) Equal to (Order(attack))
                        (Current order of NPC_Horde_AI_WarlockImp) Not equal to (Order(smart))
                    Then - Actions
                        Unit - Order NPC_Horde_AI_WarlockImp to Right-Click NPC_Horde_AI_Warlock
                    Else - Actions
                        If (All Conditions are True) then do (Then Actions) else do (Else Actions)
                            If - Conditions
                                (Current order of NPC_Horde_AI_WarlockImp) Not equal to (Order(smart))
                            Then - Actions
                                Unit - Order NPC_Horde_AI_WarlockImp to Right-Click NPC_Horde_AI_Warlock
                            Else - Actions
        -------- ===================================== --------
        -------- Remove LEAKS --------
        Custom script:   call RemoveLocation(udg_NPC_ImpVarPoint)
